        "q1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What hair type is Kérastase Nutritive best for?",
            "content": "<p>Dry to very dry hair — hair that feels rough, lacks shine, or turns brittle. Normal-to-mildly-dry hair starts with the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-nutritive-satin-shampoo-250ml\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Nutritive Satin Shampoo 250ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Nutritive Satin Shampoo</a>; intensely dry, sensitized hair steps up to the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-nutritive-satin-riche-shampoo-250ml\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Nutritive Satin Riche Shampoo 250ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Satin Riche</a>. It is not the right primary line for oily hair or scalp-specific concerns.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the difference between the Satin and Satin Riche shampoos?",
            "content": "<p>Both nourish, but Satin is the lighter, everyday formula — a hydrating cleanse for normal-to-slightly-dry hair, with no heaviness. Satin Riche is the high-nutrition version for extremely dry, sensitized hair that needs more at every wash. If your hair feels dry only after heat styling, start with Satin; if it feels chronically dry even after washing, choose Riche.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I use the Kérastase 8-Hour Magic Night Serum?",
            "content": "<p>Apply the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-8h-magic-night-serum-90ml\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Nutritive 8-Hour Magic Night Serum 90ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">8H Magic Night Serum</a> to damp or dry hair before bed, working it through the mid-lengths to ends, and leave it in overnight — no rinsing, no heat. Hair wakes softer and more luminous. Use it two to three nights a week or as needed; it is safe for colored and chemically treated hair.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the Masquintense mask right for fine hair?",
            "content": "<p>The <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-nutritive-masquintense-thick-hair-200ml\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Nutritive Masquintense Mask (Thick Hair) 200ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Masquintense Mask (Thick Hair)</a> is an ultra-rich formula built for very dry, medium-to-thick hair. If your hair is fine, you will get a better result from the ultra-light <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-nutritive-lait-vital-conditioner-200ml\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Nutritive Lait Vital Conditioner 200ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Lait Vital Conditioner</a> used consistently — it nourishes without the weight a rich mask puts on fine strands.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does Nutritive include a heat protectant?",
            "content": "<p>Yes — the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-nutritive-lotion-thermique-blow-dry-mist-150ml\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Nutritive Thermique Blow-Dry Mist 150ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Nutritive Thermique Blow-Dry Mist</a> is the range's leave-in heat protectant: a light, milky detangling mist for dry fine-to-medium hair, applied to towel-dried hair before every blow-dry. The 8H Night Serum, by contrast, is a no-heat overnight step — the two cover different moments in the routine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where can I buy authentic Kérastase Nutritive in the Philippines?",
            "content": "<p>HairMNL is an authorized Kérastase retailer, and every product is 100% authentic. Buying from unauthorized marketplace sellers risks a counterfeit formula. The full range, with current prices, is at the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/collections/kerastase-nutritive\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Nutritive at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Kérastase Nutritive collection</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
